# What ripgrep (`rg`) skips by default, beside what .gitignore does: history and folders an agent
# opens only by name (CLAUDE.md, *Layout*, *Reading*). A path given to rg explicitly is still
# searched: `rg foo whiteboard/<your thread>/`. `--no-ignore-dot` searches everything here.
# A pattern with a slash holds only for searches from the root: put it in that folder's .ignore.
**/CHANGELOG.md
.changeset/
human/
whiteboard/
winboard/
